Yup, you're looking at the SRM all right.  It sounds like the "dual boot" 
screen you saw earlier was the ARC console -- meaning, your box is set up
to boot to Linux or NT from the ARC... you may not be able to boot Linux
from the SRM (it is possible to do so using aboot, but your box is probably
configured to run Milo from the ARC instead).

The short answer is, type "arc" and hit return and after the box reboots 
you should see the blue-screen boot menu again.


