	21264 as it also has 5 times the memory bandwidth of the others.

	That is a vast gulf.  Of course the others aren't standing still so
	add 10-30% to their current scores.  Howerver, their memory bandwidth
	isn't going to change much at all.  That is a BIG 21264 advantage.

