to link these with the VAX C RTL on any machine going back to 5.0.
I've succesfully linked these same .OBJ's on machines going back to
microVMS 4.6, even.

Now the problem might be how to transport a binary .OBJ's file onto your
system, seeing how you apparently have no way to get one there (I
presume this is the reason you need UUDECODE.)  I would suggest
installing KERMIT-32 via the .HEX file available at kermit.columbia.edu.

Tim. (shoppa@triumf.ca)



