>From : http://csgrad.cs.vt.edu/~tjohnson/pinouts/#communications (a very useful site)

Console on a DEC VAXstation 3100 or DECstation 3100:

connector: MMJ jack
         _____________
        | 1 2 3 4 5 6 |
         ---------.  .
                   --- 
                          Corresponding 25 pin RS-232 pins
1 DTR                                  20
2 TD (+)                                2
3 TD (-)                                7
4 RD (-)                                7
5 RD (+)                                3
6 DSR                                   6

This isn't RS-232, its a differential interface (hence the + and - pins) 
(RS-422?).

I think you have to change a link to enable the console port - got it written down somewhere....


