Mike the PLC 5/60 has the ability to have 4 communication ports.  To use
the ethernet option you have to give up two of the communication ports.
Our engineers are real animate about not being able to give up two
ports.
Therefore, our only options are to talk to one of the DF1/RS-232
communication ports that are left available.  To do this we have to talk
via Terminal Servers.

Thanks for your response.  It would really be nice to talk via Ethernet,
but that is not currently one of our options.

