Which type of application do you want to produce?

Graphical? 

 => Galaxy, as suggested. 
    Be prepared for sub-optimal results on most/all platforms.

 => Develop for main platform (alas, probably Win32) and then port using
    win32 kits from 3rd parties.

Just plain C?

