I am looking for the ability to use a CD-ROM with local modifications to 
some files.  Actually, I do not want to modify the files on the CD-ROM. I 
want to be able to supersede a small subset of the files that are on the 
CD-ROM with files on the hard drive. Specifically I want to supersede 
some of the files in some of the directories on the C-ROM with files in 
various directories on the hard drive.

I see this having Named Paths that specify which directories on the hard 
drive(s) supersede which directories on the CD-ROM.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
For example:
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Named Path	Value
--------------	-----
source		/user/cwh/src  ,  /cd/project/src_0012
import_apple	/user/cwh/imp_a  ,  /cd/apple/exp_0003

Contents of /user/cwh/src
-------------------------
w.c	x.c

Contents of /user/cwh/imp_a
---------------------------
x.olb

Contents of cd/project/src_0012
