Note that the examples only have a few files. In actual use there will be 
hundreds of files in the directories like cd/project/src_0012.

Also note that the simple use of a general purpose path will not work 
as there are two x.h files on the CD-ROM (/cd/project/src_0012/x.h and 
/cd/apple/exp_0003/x.h).  Thus there needs to be a way to reference both 
x.h files.
