>In article <32A7B827.9EE@elliott.net>, Cameron Elliott <cam@elliott.net> wrote:
>
>> This is making me sick, I've seen numerous companies refering
>> to their 500Mhz systems as benchmarking at 15+ on the Specint95
>> benchmark.

