Ketil's formula of system administration overhead:

	W = \sum Gi*log(1+Si)

W  = work
Si = numer of systems of type i
Gi = gorilla factor, dependent on the network manageabiltiy of the
     system.  Typically Unix:1, PC:2, Xterminal:0.5

