The switches look fine..This board is set for msa0: base address 17772522, a 
TS11 look a like.
If you plug it in even without the drive connected, the board should be seen 
by the system. Use sysgen to verify its there..
MC sysgen
sysgen>sho /conf
Or
sysgen sho /uni
With this you will see the board is on 1772522 and 1772524. with the /conf 
option, you should see the controller but if the drive is not connect of 
connect wrong, the device will sho as offline.
Hope this helps.
   -Doug-



